{"id":"d547d7414660f6bd","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-lambda-term.md","title":"λ 项、自由变量与 α 等价","display":"df-lambda-term — λ 项、自由变量与 α 等价","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-lambda-term","aliases":["56-df-lambda-term"],"display":"df-lambda-term — λ 项、自由变量与 α 等价","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Definitions 10.1.1,10.1.4 and Notation 10.1.7, printed pp548–550","source_ocr_block":"569–571","source_status":"source-statement-compared; explicit-local-alpha-construction"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-lambda-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-lambda-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lambda-term — λ 项、自由变量与 α 等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Definitions 10.1.1,10.1.4 and Notation 10.1.7, printed pp548–550"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"569–571"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-compared; explicit-local-alpha-construction"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>，常元集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 不交；应用和抽象是自由语法构造子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq V^2\">\\(E\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 为允许改名的等价关系，每个等价类可数无限且配有无重复的枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(v_n^{C})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((v_n^{C})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in V/E\">\\(C\\in V/E\\)</span>）；无类型时取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=V^2\">\\(E=V^2\\)</span>，有类型时只允许同类型变量改名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in V^V\">\\(\\pi\\in V^V\\)</span>；常元分支中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 仅在该分支遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\varnothing\">\\(F=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 遍历下式构造的原始项集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\">\\(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\">\\(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\\)</span>。交换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{x,y}\">\\(\\pi_{x,y}\\)</span> 在断言中给出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqCong}_{\\lambda}(Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{EqCong}_{\\lambda}(Q)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 是原始项上的等价关系，且对应用及每个固定变量的抽象构造子相容，此谓词在断言中展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{x,y}\\coloneqq\\{(x,y),(y,x)\\}\\cup\\{(z,z):z\\in V\\setminus\\{x,y\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_{x,y}\\coloneqq\\{(x,y),(y,x)\\}\\cup\\{(z,z):z\\in V\\setminus\\{x,y\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_0\\coloneqq V\\cup F,\\qquad\\Lambda_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\Lambda_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in\\Lambda_n\\}\\cup\\{\\lambda x.M:x\\in V,M\\in\\Lambda_n\\},\\qquad\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Lambda_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Lambda_0\\coloneqq V\\cup F,\\qquad\\Lambda_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\Lambda_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in\\Lambda_n\\}\\cup\\{\\lambda x.M:x\\in V,M\\in\\Lambda_n\\},\\qquad\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Lambda_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(x)\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(f)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(f\\in F),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(MN)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(M)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(N),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FV}(x)\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(f)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(f\\in F),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(MN)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(M)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(N),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AV}(x)\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{AV}(f)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(f\\in F),\\quad\\mathrm{AV}(MN)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AV}(M)\\cup\\mathrm{AV}(N),\\quad\\mathrm{AV}(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AV}(M)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AV}(x)\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{AV}(f)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(f\\in F),\\quad\\mathrm{AV}(MN)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AV}(M)\\cup\\mathrm{AV}(N),\\quad\\mathrm{AV}(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AV}(M)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\cdot x\\coloneqq\\pi(x),\\quad\\pi\\cdot f\\coloneqq f\\quad(f\\in F),\\quad\\pi\\cdot(MN)\\coloneqq(\\pi\\cdot M)(\\pi\\cdot N),\\quad\\pi\\cdot(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\lambda\\pi(x).(\\pi\\cdot M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi\\cdot x\\coloneqq\\pi(x),\\quad\\pi\\cdot f\\coloneqq f\\quad(f\\in F),\\quad\\pi\\cdot(MN)\\coloneqq(\\pi\\cdot M)(\\pi\\cdot N),\\quad\\pi\\cdot(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\lambda\\pi(x).(\\pi\\cdot M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqCong}_{\\lambda}(Q)\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\subseteq(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2\\land\\{(M,M):M\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\}\\subseteq Q\\land Q^{-1}=Q\\land Q\\circ Q\\subseteq Q\\land\\forall M,M&#39;,N,N&#39;\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\bigl((M,M&#39;)\\in Q\\land(N,N&#39;)\\in Q\\Longrightarrow(MN,M&#39;N&#39;)\\in Q\\bigr)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\forall(M,N)\\in Q\\;((\\lambda x.M,\\lambda x.N)\\in Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EqCong}_{\\lambda}(Q)\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\subseteq(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2\\land\\{(M,M):M\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\}\\subseteq Q\\land Q^{-1}=Q\\land Q\\circ Q\\subseteq Q\\land\\forall M,M&#39;,N,N&#39;\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\bigl((M,M&#39;)\\in Q\\land(N,N&#39;)\\in Q\\Longrightarrow(MN,M&#39;N&#39;)\\in Q\\bigr)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\forall(M,N)\\in Q\\;((\\lambda x.M,\\lambda x.N)\\in Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_E\\coloneqq\\{(\\lambda x.M,\\lambda y.(\\pi_{x,y}\\cdot M)):M\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}},\\ (x,y)\\in E,\\ y\\notin\\mathrm{AV}(M)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_E\\coloneqq\\{(\\lambda x.M,\\lambda y.(\\pi_{x,y}\\cdot M)):M\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}},\\ (x,y)\\in E,\\ y\\notin\\mathrm{AV}(M)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{Q\\subseteq(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2:\\mathrm{EqCong}_{\\lambda}(Q)\\land G_E\\subseteq Q\\},\\qquad\\Lambda(V,F,E)\\coloneqq\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)/{\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{Q\\subseteq(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2:\\mathrm{EqCong}_{\\lambda}(Q)\\land G_E\\subseteq Q\\},\\qquad\\Lambda(V,F,E)\\coloneqq\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)/{\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall M,N\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\bigl(M\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}N\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{FV}(M)=\\mathrm{FV}(N)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall M,N\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\bigl(M\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}N\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{FV}(M)=\\mathrm{FV}(N)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[M]_{\\alpha,E}[N]_{\\alpha,E}\\coloneqq[MN]_{\\alpha,E},\\qquad\\lambda x.[M]_{\\alpha,E}\\coloneqq[\\lambda x.M]_{\\alpha,E},\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}_{\\alpha,E}([M]_{\\alpha,E})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[M]_{\\alpha,E}[N]_{\\alpha,E}\\coloneqq[MN]_{\\alpha,E},\\qquad\\lambda x.[M]_{\\alpha,E}\\coloneqq[\\lambda x.M]_{\\alpha,E},\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}_{\\alpha,E}([M]_{\\alpha,E})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依据原书 Definitions 10.1.1、10.1.4、Notation 10.1.7（印刷 pp548–550，OCR 页块569–571），并内建其改名约定。FV、AV 递归于有限语法树。α 定义使用全体关系的交；全关系给出非空候选族，因此构造良定义。有类型实例必须使用同类型改名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"(v_n^{C})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in V/E","display":false},{"tex":"E=V^2","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in V^V","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{x,y}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqCong}_{\\lambda}(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{x,y}\\coloneqq\\{(x,y),(y,x)\\}\\cup\\{(z,z):z\\in V\\setminus\\{x,y\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Lambda_0\\coloneqq V\\cup F,\\qquad\\Lambda_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\Lambda_n\\cup\\{MN:M,N\\in\\Lambda_n\\}\\cup\\{\\lambda x.M:x\\in V,M\\in\\Lambda_n\\},\\qquad\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\Lambda_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(x)\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(f)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(f\\in F),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(MN)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(M)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(N),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AV}(x)\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad\\mathrm{AV}(f)\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(f\\in F),\\quad\\mathrm{AV}(MN)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AV}(M)\\cup\\mathrm{AV}(N),\\quad\\mathrm{AV}(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AV}(M)\\cup\\{x\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi\\cdot x\\coloneqq\\pi(x),\\quad\\pi\\cdot f\\coloneqq f\\quad(f\\in F),\\quad\\pi\\cdot(MN)\\coloneqq(\\pi\\cdot M)(\\pi\\cdot N),\\quad\\pi\\cdot(\\lambda x.M)\\coloneqq\\lambda\\pi(x).(\\pi\\cdot M).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqCong}_{\\lambda}(Q)\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\subseteq(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2\\land\\{(M,M):M\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\}\\subseteq Q\\land Q^{-1}=Q\\land Q\\circ Q\\subseteq Q\\land\\forall M,M',N,N'\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\bigl((M,M')\\in Q\\land(N,N')\\in Q\\Longrightarrow(MN,M'N')\\in Q\\bigr)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\forall(M,N)\\in Q\\;((\\lambda x.M,\\lambda x.N)\\in Q).","display":true},{"tex":"G_E\\coloneqq\\{(\\lambda x.M,\\lambda y.(\\pi_{x,y}\\cdot M)):M\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}},\\ (x,y)\\in E,\\ y\\notin\\mathrm{AV}(M)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{Q\\subseteq(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2:\\mathrm{EqCong}_{\\lambda}(Q)\\land G_E\\subseteq Q\\},\\qquad\\Lambda(V,F,E)\\coloneqq\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)/{\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall M,N\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}\\;\\bigl(M\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}N\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{FV}(M)=\\mathrm{FV}(N)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"[M]_{\\alpha,E}[N]_{\\alpha,E}\\coloneqq[MN]_{\\alpha,E},\\qquad\\lambda x.[M]_{\\alpha,E}\\coloneqq[\\lambda x.M]_{\\alpha,E},\\qquad\\mathrm{FV}_{\\alpha,E}([M]_{\\alpha,E})\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(M).","display":true}],"bytes":3528,"backlinks":[{"id":"650401013847f443","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定 [[56-df-lambda-term]] 的 $\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)$ 与 $\\equiv_{\\alpha,E}$，替换见 [[56-df-lambda-substitution]]。$\\to_\\beta,\\to_\\eta$ 在原始项上定义，再按代表元存在量化下降到 α 商；用同一符号表示。$\\mathrm{Compat}_\\lambda(Q)$ 在断言中展开，是应用及抽象下的闭包条件。"},{"id":"c7d107c2c14774de","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定非空带类型签名 $(F,\\tau_F)$。$H_A,H,H_A^{\\mathrm{raw}},\\nu_A,\\bar h$、出现路径、绑定集合与最大应用脊见 [[56-df-higher-order-terms]]；$\\simeq_A$ 是其中明确引用的固定类型 βη 转换。令 $L_0=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)$、$W_\\lambda=\\{1,2\\}^{<\\omega}$。$M$ 为集合参数，Pattern 使用同一个原始代表元计算所有出现路径。商上应用、抽象及 $\\mathrm{FV}_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}$ 见 [[56-df-lambda-term]]。$\\lambda(z_1,\\ldots,z_n).l$ 表示按列表次序的嵌套商上抽象，空列表时为 $l$；连续应用左结合，空应用列表时为头本身。$R$ 为集合参数，以下 $I_R$ 与 $\\to_H$ 仅对 $R\\subseteq\\mathrm{HRule}$ 定义。$Q$ 是关系参数。"},{"id":"752f53ceb23d931c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"96add5833bb7dcac","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-lambda-term]] 的原始项、各允许改名等价类的枚举与关系 $E$。$M,N,M_1,M_2$ 为原始项，$x,y\\in V$；常元分支仅对 $f\\in F$ 给出，不要求 $F$ 非空。函数 $\\zeta_E$ 的输入域为 $(\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}})^2\\times V^2$；每个 $E$-类无限而有限项的全变量集有限。令 $\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,F,E)$；$m,n,q\\in\\Lambda$ 表示 α 等价类。原始项替换与商上替换使用相同方括号记法，由输入所在集合区分；商上函数 $\\mathrm{LSub}_{V,F,E}$ 的参数次序是被替换项、变量、代入项。"},{"id":"884fb16496d08ed1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定非空基本类型集 $\\mathcal B$，类型构造子 $\\Rightarrow$ 为自由二元构造子：其值与基本类型不交，且 $A\\Rightarrow B=A'\\Rightarrow B'\\iff(A=A'\\land B=B')$。对每个简单类型 $A$ 给定两两不交的可数无限变量集 $V_A$，并固定其无重复枚举 $(v_{A,n})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$；设 $V=\\bigcup_A V_A$，常元集 $F$ 与 $V$ 不交，常元类型函数为 $\\tau_F:F\\to\\mathrm{Typ}$，变量类型函数为 $\\tau_V(x)=A$（$x\\in V_A$）。令 $L_0=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,F)$ 为 [[56-df-lambda-term]] 的有限原始项集，$M,N\\in L_0$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$A,B\\in\\mathrm{Typ}$。$\\Gamma$ 是有限的同类型变量环境。此处采用仅含箭头的片段，不引入积类型。"},{"id":"864a35781ae3b23f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取基本类型集 $\\mathcal B=\\{o\\}$。$\\mathsf{abs},\\mathsf{app}$ 为两个互异常元，$F=\\{\\mathsf{abs},\\mathsf{app}\\}$；$z\\in V_{o\\Rightarrow o}$、$w,x\\in V_o$。常元类型图由下式给出，原始语法取 [[56-df-lambda-term]]。$H,\\nu_o,\\bar w$、合法规则与 $\\to_H$ 采用 [[56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system]] 的内部依赖。"},{"id":"af80c4c087c85f9a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在无类型 λ 演算中取互异变量 $x,z,a,b\\in V$；令 $L_0=\\Lambda^{\\mathrm{raw}}(V,\\varnothing)$、$\\Lambda=\\Lambda(V,\\varnothing,V^2)$，$[M]_\\alpha=[M]_{\\alpha,V^2}$。$\\to_\\beta$ 是 [[56-df-beta-reduction]] 的 α 商上归约关系。下式中 $\\Omega,I,K,N$ 均取商元素；两个商元素的应用和 $\\lambda b.I$ 取 [[56-df-lambda-term]] 的商上构造。$\\mathrm{NF},\\mathrm{WNAt},\\mathrm{SNAt}$ 见相应 ARS 节点。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-289","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-term.md]]"}],"outgoing":[]}